# The shared .editorconfig sets end_of_line = lf, and IDE0055 is an error: without this, a Windows checkout gets CRLF
# and every C# line fails the build. Binary files a repository adds need their own `binary` line below.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.snk binary
*.nupkg binary
*.zip binary
